24332  EQUATIONS
24333   
24334          objective                               objective function
24335          mass_balance1(i)                        steady state mass balance
24336   
24337          lower_bound(j)                          lower bounds on reactions
24338          upper_bound(j)                          upper bounds on reactions
24339  ;
24340  **************************************************************
