24346          obj                                     objective value
24347  ;
24348   
24349  ****************************************************************
24350   
24351  ***************Defining Model***********************************
24352  objective..                     obj =e= v('Seed_Biomass[K]');
24353   
24354  mass_balance1(i)..              sum(j, S(i,j) * v(j)) =e= 0;
24355   
24356   
24357  lower_bound(j)..                v_min(j) =l= v(j);
24358   
24359  upper_bound(j)..                v(j) =l= v_max(j);
24360   
24361  ***************Set bounds***********************************
24362   
24363   
24364  Model arabidopsis_root /all/;
24365   
24366  ******************************************************************
24367   
24368  **********Solving Model*********************
24369   
24370  Solve arabidopsis_root using lp maximizing obj;
24371   
